'''Blizzard''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that is was obtainable by purchasing the [[Snowstorm Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2025|2025 Christmas Event]], or by [[trading]]. It is only obtainable through trading as the gamepass has gone offsale

== Appearance ==
The gun is mainly a snowy white with light blue icy spikes protruding from various parts.

== Trivia ==
* It pairs with the godly knife [[Snowstorm]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Blizzard Set|Blizzard Set]].
* It has a chroma counterpart under the name [[Chroma Blizzard|Chroma Blizzard.]]
* This is the first godly gun from an item pack to not have a gamepass to buy it separately from the bundle

